<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="toc3">Zec.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zechariah Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="mt">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zechariah Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Haggai samlia keraibe cai keina cai (520 BC) Zechariah caihadung rangcu di.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pe samlia kera gade Zechariah au minadung kerecaki teidai ndeu kebamme de Tinggwang sam caihakecime dade Tinggwang sam kingnei lulo ranggai. Penui Tinggwang de mnasiak la maikesia iciu eh tutiak gwasi di kelakne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sam kerai aide makengau caisui eh cide ne heta keteime heta püt gailai kebam dau penuide teingku beu. Zechariah penui dage Tinggwang au Israel ziemne mariem kedi bam lie rang eh penui lung relui lu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pesau 7 nah 8 ga Zechariah minadung de mcigi eh nah kengaugia eh Tinggwang samzai teilu lo ranggai. Samzai ketei pesui la.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pesau 9 gade 14 ga Messiah lunggwang kera ranggai, tutiak kamtube nah hegwangram kekambe lung cuh kera ha.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Samzai tei lulo qukegai (1:1-6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Makengau (1:7-6:15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Samzai nah hezaidung (7:1-8:23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel ngauraume tutiak (9:1-14:21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube da Cailigwanglo kequ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1" />Darius Persia gwang tei kelu mmi kena bekum kei heset bekei, RAMPAUBE sam Iddo napei Berechiah napei Zechariah, caihakecibe da gwang, rang eh,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ezr. 4:24; 5:1</char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2" />“RAMPAUBE nnui paumedung de perata süt dida! <verse eid="ZEC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3" />Penuide ranglo, ‘Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rang bam:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 1:3">A da nreu gwanglu!, aide Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndu gai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 1:3">nah Ih nnui da cailigwang zie, Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hos. 6:1, Jas. 4:8</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4" />Nnui paumedung nzwa lung diso ndaa caihakecime penui dage nra kegaide, rang eh, “Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rang: Nnui kesia lampuidung nah kesia tah keteidung gade nreu lu!” Dede penui kingnei ma nah a dage helung kaima, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu gai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jer. 7:24; 17:23; 29:19</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5" />Nnui paumedung, penui daiga bam no? Caihakecimedung daiga bam no, penui aika kelungta bam ni?<verse eid="ZEC 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6" />Dede a samdung nah a ajadung a kilame caihakecimedung dage Ih ne teilu lo kebeu bedung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 1:6">penui nnui paumedung de gikah tetdi meluini?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ZEC 1:6">Cine penui mau petlu nah rangdi, ‘Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne anui lampuidung nah tadung nsam gade anui dage teigai kera riem kegai nzwa, ciu eh pa ne anui dage teigai.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 2:17">Keh. 2:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Myrtle Bangdung kakga Minabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7" />Kei kereieket zie ngkaiehmdai benai, cide au Shebat bekei, Darius hegwang ketei mmi kena bekum, RAMPAUBE sam Iddo napei Berechiah napei Zechariah, caihakecibe da gwang, rang eh, <verse eid="ZEC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8" />“Ainie! Ih ting kemui dau mige hekwen kegie ge teu kela ngau, nah pa myrtle bang kakga hangdeu langkam ga la; nah pecai ga hekwen kegie ge, kegie kedau ge nah keha ge la.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:4">Keu. 6:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9" />Ih ranggai, “Hekwen aidungde daino, Rampaubo?” Cidau tinggimgwame acu ngngwa mpau kebamme ada ranggai, “Ih ncu hekwen aidungde daibi keulia zie.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10" />Pecai myrtle bangdung kakga sap kebambe keli gai nah rangdi, “Cidungde de RAMPAUBE ne kideu pelane ga rwa kera lang mpet gai.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11" />Penui RAMPAUBE tinggimgwabe myrtle bangdung kakga sap kebambe dage keli; penui pe dage ranggai, “Anui kideu pelane ga rwa mie; pielo, kideu pelane mtak sünne nah relui bam.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12" />Ge RAMPAUBE tinggimgwabe keligai nah rangdi, “Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, nang dai tiege Jerusalem de nah Judah namdidung dage ngaugia keulia mene bam luzie no, nang mmi riakhena ge nrata eh bam kedi de?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:10">Keu. 6:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13" />RAMPAUBE acu ngngwa mpau kegai tinggimgwabe dage sam keyidung, kenciep samdung le keligai. <verse eid="ZEC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14" />Cine tinggimgwabe acu ngngwa kempau kegaibe ne a dage rang, “Qu gai nah rang lo, ‘Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 1:14">Ih Jerusalem nah Zion ziemne a lungnei süt bam!<verse eid="ZEC 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15" />Heleuhdung lungnei gah eh ziune lungh kebamdung de a rata süt.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 1:15">Ih penui da a rata nghim kebam dau, penui kengkap a kemning swa tei ngkiee si gai.<verse eid="ZEC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16" />Cine Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rang:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 1:16">Ih ngaugiadung teu Jerusalem ga cailigwang luda. Cikage a reca ki tei luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 1:16">aide Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, nah kemdet tie kezang pet Jerusalem leune ga mdet zie!<verse eid="ZEC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17" />Qugai dailo, rang eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 1:17">‘Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla: A namdidung lungh keyi le pui dai luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 1:17">nah RAMPAUBE Zion dage lungciep peudai zie, nah pa Jerusalem de pe kemlang namdi kedet dai luzie.’”<verse eid="ZEC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makiidung Mdai nah Hegeu kerekime Mdai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18" />Pecai Ih a miakdung ngang cuh piegai nah makaune kiidung mdai ngau! <verse eid="ZEC 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19" />Tinggimgwabe acu ngngwa kempau kecube dage Ih rang, “Aipau kiidung de dai no?” Pa acu keligai, “Makii aidungde Judah, Israel nah Jerusalem de teu zangra kedidung de da.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20" />Cidau RAMPAUBE a dage hetaciem kecime hangmdai de liagai. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21" />Ih ranggai, “Mina aidungde dai tei kerane gwang lano?” Pa keligai, nah rang, “Ma kii aidungde ne Judah de teu zangra di iciu eh penui migede de peu pepeu ngangcuh melu kerane. Dede hegeu kerekime penuide keheu kerane gwang, heleuhdung gu pekiidung teu cuh pwa Judah deu de renia eh teu zangra di melu kerane.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2" />
  <para style="s">Mige Kemdet Ria ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1" />Pecai Ih a miak ngang cuh piegai nah mi ge pe ba ga kemdet ria keulwe kebam ngau. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2" />Ih ranggai, “Nang daiga mie lau no?” Cine pa a dage rang, “Jerusalem pedi nah petie daikiee ge bi mdet lwe cide cilu kerane.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:15">Keu. 21:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3" />Cidau tinggimgwabe acu mpau kecube de tetdi nah tinggimgwame keda ge pecu redau kerane gwang. <verse eid="ZEC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4" />Tinggimgwabe pekenabe pe dage rang, “Pakmie eh cipau rehang pei de resiu lu; rangbeu lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:4">‘Jerusalem au deudi kiriedung gwale lungh dizie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:4">kedanemene mina nah makaune maadung kiee ham kedine.<verse eid="ZEC 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5" />Kedanemene Ih, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, miheu rie le pwane Jerusalem twagwa luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:5">nah Ih namdi lungga de kendube dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 13:21-22, Isa. 4:5</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6" />Cuhlu! Cuhlu! Tingtünle deu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babylon</char></note> gade pak dilu, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:6">kedanemene tinggimdung gade tingkai mdai nzwa Ih nnuide teizang dida!, Aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="ZEC 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7" />Cuhlu! Zion gage pakgai lu, Babylon napuidung de ngngwa lungh kebammedung!’”<verse eid="ZEC 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8" />Kedanemene Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE acu herüt peu kegai cia nah heleuhdung nnui gu süt ketyeime de renia kerane acu langgai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:8">cine caugamme nnuide tung bi, Tinggwang pie kebam pekumedung de tung!, RAMPAUBE aide tei kedicai, pa ranggai,<verse eid="ZEC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9" />“Ih penuide renia cuh eh a ba hwa gaizie, nah penui kilabaangme ne penuide ngkap zie.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:9">Cidau Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne acu lang kegai nang ci luzie.<verse eid="ZEC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10" />RAMPAUBE rang, “Suiyi lei tei lu, Zion napui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">kedanemene Ih nnui da gwang eh nnui kakga bam di kerane!, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zep. 3:14</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11" />Pecai cipaunai heleuh kekiee ge RAMPAUBE da ncüt luzie. Pa ranggai, “Cidau nnui a mina tei luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:11">kedanemene Ih nnui kakga lungh zie,” nah Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne acu lang kegai nang cilu zie.<verse eid="ZEC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE kemci deu gade pe mapwa kesang ge nzwa Judah de gum luzie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">Nah piage Jerusalem de pekatei peziemne kedet dai luzie.<verse eid="ZEC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13" />Zing delu, mina leune, RAMPAUBE dwa gade, kedanemene pecu au pe kemci ni gade teu cuh kelune!<verse eid="ZEC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3" />
  <para style="s">Cingku Kehube ziemne Paini Kemci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1" />Pecai RAMPAUBE acu cingku kedibe Joshua RAMPAUBE tinggimgwabe dwaga sap kebam keulia gai nah Satan pe zetle pecu mmau gai kera sap bam. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2" />RAMPAUBE tinggimgwabe Satan dage ranggai, “Peu RAMPAUBE de ncu kesiu gai, Satan; peu RAMPAUBE, Jerusalem de kedet kelube de, ncu kesiu gai! Mina aide tsingtie ge mi gade teu mpet kelu nzwa meni?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:33">Rom. 8:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3" />Joshua tinggimgwabe dwaga penia keheradung teu delwe sap bam. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4" />Tinggimgwabe pedwa ga sap kebammedung dage ranggai, “Penia keheradung de ra di.” Pecai pa Joshua dage ranggai, “Pielo! Ih n maudung n dade keugi dida nah mania keyi gele Ih ncu ba beuzie.” <verse eid="ZEC 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5" />Pecai Ih ranggai, “Penuide de peu pe peu gage peuzui kemci ge kaibeu!” Cine penui Joshua peu gage peuzui kemci ge kaibeu nah mania mci kecube ge peu teulu, RAMPAUBE tinggimgwame petai ga sap kebam tingdau.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6" />Pecai RAMPAUBE tinggimgwabe Joshua da aja kai nah rang, <verse eid="ZEC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7" />“Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 3:7">Nang a lampuidung ga pwalu cai, nah a ajadung de mzailu cai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 3:7">nang a ki pie rengei nah kekwabe tei zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 3:7">kedanemene Ih ncu peu tet zie nah a dwa sap kebammedung kakga peu gwang zie.<verse eid="ZEC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8" />Kingneilu, cingku kedibe Joshua, nang nah n kangzangme cingkume ncu ngngwa lungh kebamme!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 3:8">Kedanemene mina aidungde marengei ge, Ih a kilabe de teu cuhlu zie, Pekiakbe de qu kelabe de.<verse eid="ZEC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9" />Cu Ih Joshua dwa gage tangtsu kai pwa kebam de pie gailo. Miak hena ge aipau tangtsu ge ga bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 3:9">nah Ih ma ge raugai zie, aide Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndugai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 3:9">nah langnai ge gage Ih hangdeu aikade kemau keugi dizie.<verse eid="ZEC 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10" />Cipau benai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cipau benai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aipau tingba de cai mina maudung keugi kedi tingba</char></note>, aide Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, mipei hangge ge kecu pe kubebang nah nzüttsibang kangga ntum lulo de pe kidabe de qu zie.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4" />
  <para style="s">Kecak Mibung nah Olive Bang Kemci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1" />Ge tinggimgwabe acu resiu kebambe de nreu gwang nah mige zip bam eh tei nrak kegai nzwa acu tei nrak gai. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2" />Pa a dage ranggai, “Nang daipai ngau zeu no?” Ih ranggai, “Kecak le tei kelu mitaubung bam ge ngaubam, pe reu ga ma kwak ge bam eh. Cika mitaubung hena bam nah mitaubung reu ga kemtauriadung pe ramcau bam. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3" />Pe mbie ga olive bang kena ge bam, ket hekwak zetle nah kedage hile bie bam.” <verse eid="ZEC 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4" />Cine acu resiu kebam tinggimgwabe dage Ih ranggai dai. Ih ranggai, “Aidungde pekie daino, a mpaubo?” <verse eid="ZEC 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5" />Tinggimgwabe acu resiu kebambe de acu keli eh ranggai, “Nang aidungde daibi pe kie cimeni?” Ih ranggai, “Cima, a mpaubo.” <verse eid="ZEC 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6" />Cine pa a dage ranggai, “Aide RAMPAUBE Zerubbabel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zerubbabel: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Judah deuceudi be; Shealtiel napei, Jehoiachin capei, 597 B.C. dau langgi kedibe Judah gwangpei (2 Heg. 24:15). Pa cai Hegwangpei David Leuhme (Hag. 1:1)</char></note> dage sam kai kegai de da: Renci le ma mede kengkieng le ma, dede a Rabe le, de eh Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang. <verse eid="ZEC 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7" />Nang daino, lamlwatu kedibe? Zerubbabel dwa gade nang au langkie ge dizie, nah pa tangtsu nreutu de kamgai de, minadung sah zie ‘Ngaugia! Ngaugia!’”<verse eid="ZEC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8" />RAMPAUBE sam a da gwang, rang eh, <verse eid="ZEC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9" />“Zerubbabel ba le aipau ki bangdwa teigai da nah pe ba le aide teicang zie.” Iciude nang ci luzie Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne acu n da langgai lie kecu.<verse eid="ZEC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10" />Cauge ne makeceunadung tingba de mlai dino? Mina aidungde pesui yilu zie nah Zerubbabel ba ga kemdet tangtsu kela de ngau zie. (Mitaubung hena aidungde RAMPAUBE miakdung kideu reu pelane ga rwa kela deda.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 15:3">Mac. 15:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11" />Pecai Ih tinggimgwabe de keteu gai, “Mitaubung gu zetle nah hile ga olive bang kena sap kebam pekie daino?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:4">Keu. 11:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEC 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12" />Ih pecu piage keteu gai dai, “Kecak ca kecak ping kena gade lwa mpet kebam mbie ga olive kiak kena kebam pe kie daino?” <verse eid="ZEC 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13" />Ge pa a da ranggai, “Nang aidungde daibi pe kie cimeni?” Ih ranggai, “Cima, a mpaubo.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14" />Pecai tinggimgwabe rang, “Mina aipau kena de Tinggwang ne pe tatei kerane kedet nah keniak kelume da, kideu pelane reu Rampaube.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5" />
  <para style="s">Lim Kela Laisiu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1" />Pecai Ih nreu gwang nah a miak ngang piegai, nah ainie, laisiudum ge lim kela, Ih ngau! <verse eid="ZEC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2" />Tinggimgwabe a dage ranggai, “Nang daipai ngau zeu no?” Ih keligai, “Laisiudum ge lim kela Ih ngau, petie cubit ngkai nah pedi cubit kerei.” <verse eid="ZEC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3" />Pecai pa a dage ranggai, “Laisiudum de ga deudi pelane reuga gwang kera reset de rauteu la. Kedanemene ket lambie rang kela ria gade keregame leune de keugi dizie, nah keheibede kenret sampetdung tei kelame de keda lambie rang pwa kebam ria gade keugi dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pum. 5:23-28, Hez. 28:15-68, Eze. 2:9-10</char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4" />Ih reset aide lang mpet gai zie, aide Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, cine cide keregame ki nah a zi teu kenret sampetdung tei kelame ki ga nlüt zie. Cide pe kiga bam dizie nah pe tsingdung nah tangtsudung ngkap dizie.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Marak ga Mipui ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5" />Pecai acu resiu kebam tinggimgwabe mpet nah ada ranggai, “N miak ngang cuhlu nah pielo dai gwangla bi!” <verse eid="ZEC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6" />Ih keteugai, “Cide daino?” Pa keligai, “Aide au ciu mdet kera biaktui ge, nah cide au hangdeu pelane ga mina leune mau le pui bam.” <verse eid="ZEC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7" />Pecai biaktui gum hegeu le teikelube keu mpet gai nah cika mipui ge pelung ga ntum bam! <verse eid="ZEC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8" />Tinggimgwabe ranggai, “Aide au makesia!” Pa pecu biaktui lung gage keling nlwet gai dai, nah pa pegum de keling pwa ngkei kebam de gumdi. <verse eid="ZEC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9" />Ih ngang cuh piegai nah mipui hangna a taiga gwang kela Ih ngau, nah tingkai penai hesiu ga bam, kedanemene penai hesiu kebamde duirui hesiu nzwa. Penai biaktui de kideu nah tinggim kakga pwa cuh lu. <verse eid="ZEC 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10" />Cine acu resiu kebam tinggimgwabe dage Ih keteugai, “Penai biaktui de dai gage keu mie di launo?” <verse eid="ZEC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11" />Pa a dage rang, “Biaktui de ziemne Shinar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Shinar: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babylonia zi kehegwabe, Ken. 11:2 gade ngaulu zie.</char></note> deu gage kerecaki ge tei kera, ciu eh kerecaki de teicang keludau, cide ga biaktui kaikera singkam telei pwakebam ga kai luzie.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6" />
  <para style="s">Hekwenbagi Mdai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1" />Pecai Ih nreugwang nah a miak ngang cuh gai nah bagidung mdai lamlwatu kena kakgade gwang kela Ih ngau; nah lamlwatu kena de hetageu gele tei pwabam. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2" />Bagi raitube de hekwen kegiedung ge ne ngngwa la, bagi pe kenabe de hekwen ketiakdung ge ne ngngwa la, <verse eid="ZEC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3" />bagi pe kecumbe de hekwen kehadung ge ne ngngwa la, nah bagi pe mdaibe de puu eh pedau keteibe de ngngwa la.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 6:2,4,5,8; 19:11</char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4" />Cine Ih keligai nah acu resiu kebam tinggimgwabe dage ranggai, “Aidungde daino, a mpaubo?” <verse eid="ZEC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5" />Tinggimgwabe acu keligai nah ada ranggai, “Aidungde au kideu pelane gu RAMPAUBE dwaga penui sap kebam ni gade mpet kela tinggim tingkai mdai. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6" />Hekwen ketiakdung ne ngngwa kela de tingtünle deudi gage tetkai bam; hekwen kehadung de naimiak kenlütle deudi gage tetkai bam; nah hekwen puu eh kedau kecubedung tingbangle deudi gage tetkai bam.” <verse eid="ZEC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7" />Hekwen kengking aidung tetpet nah peei kera mie nah kideu reu ga rwa neu di, cine tinggimgwabe ranggai, “Miecu nah kideu reu rwa cu!” nah penui mie eh kideube de mcetpie gwang. <verse eid="ZEC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8" />Ge pa acu qu gai nah acu resiu nah ranggai, “Tingtünle deudi gage tetkai kebamdung de pielo; penui a rabe de lungciep peu zie.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joshua ziemne Hegwangpeurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9" />Cine RAMPAUBE sam a da gwang, rang eh, <verse eid="ZEC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10" />“Langgi kedimedung dade makai keu lulo, Heldai, Tobijah, nah Jedaiah dade, nah aipaunai gage mie cu nah cide Zephaniah napei Josiah ki gage keu mie lo, Babylon gade gwang kelabe da. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11" />Pecai rangkanggeu nah kecak keulu, hegwang peurwa teilu nah Jehozadak napei cingku kedibe Joshua peu gage cwa gailu. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12" />Pecu resiu gai nah rangbeu lu, ‘Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangbam:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 6:12">Mipei aide, pe zi au Pekiak! Pa kebam gade lungh cuh zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 6:12">nah ciciulu de RAMPAUBE kerecaki teilu zie!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:2">Isa. 4:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEC 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13" />Pa ne RAMPAUBE kerecaki de tei zie, nah pecu hegwangme gu hezukeyi le bah luzie, nah bamlu zie nah pe hegwangram teu zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 6:13">Pa au pe hegwangram gade cingku ge zie, nah pa ne hangna kakga kezuyi puisau ge tei zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">Isa. 11:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14" />Heldai, Tobijah, Jedaiah, nah Zephaniah napei Hen, penuide kensung gade RAMPAUBE gu kerecaki gade hegwangpeurwa peu zie. <verse eid="ZEC 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15" />Pecai kemdei ga kelame RAMPAUBE kerecaki gwang tei zie, cinzwa eh Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne acu lang kegai de nang ci luzie; kedanemene nang RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang kwa kingnei sünne gai cai aide tei luzie!’”<verse eid="ZEC 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7" />
  <para style="s">Kenzeu nah Ngaugia, Kemmwang ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1" />Darius hegwang tei kelu mmi mdai bekum, Kislev gu lang mdai ne benai (cide au kei hekui bekei), RAMPAUBE sam Zechariah da gwang. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2" />Bethel minadung RAMPAUBE de peu penui kekie teibeu kerane Sharezer nah Regem-Melek nah penui minadung de langgai. <verse eid="ZEC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3" />Penui reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ki ga kebam cingkumedung nah caihakecimedung de resiu; penui rang eh, “Kei mengei bekei Ih mmwang eh hap zie ni, mmi kekiee ge ainzwa tei hang kela nzwa?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jewme kei mengei be kei mmwang kedanemene kei mengei be kei lang hena ne benai Babylonme ne Solomon kerecaki ngkap kedine.</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4" />Cine reugwame reu RAMPAUBE sam a da gwang eh ranggai,<verse eid="ZEC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5" />“Judah deudi ga minadung pelane nah cingkumedung de resiulu nah aide ranglu, ‘Mmi riakhena ge ziemne nang kei mengei nah kei hena bekei dau mmwang nah hap kegai de, nang a ziemne mmwang kesang bam ni? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6" />Nang tyei nah sak kecudau, nang n katei n ziemne tyei nah sak meni? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7" />Sam aidungde RAMPAUBE ne caihakecime tei kegwangme mui gade rang kebeu sam de de meni, nang Jerusalem nah twagwa kebam namdidung nah Negev, nah naimiak kenlütle ga hangdeutu pi ga lunghyi eh lungh kebam dau?’” <verse eid="ZEC 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8" />RAMPAUBE sam Zechariah da gwang eh ranggai, <verse eid="ZEC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9" />“Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ‘Kemzuibe teu eh tiak lu, samkak kelu kesamsangbe, nah ngaugiabe. Hangge ge de peu pe sinabe dade henalu nah ngaungia bamlu. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10" />Hemipui nah nggiana, sangme, nah kegame, de tei keherei so, nah nnui hangge gede tei rezam kera nnui mlung gade riem so.’ <verse eid="ZEC 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11" />Dede penui penui lung kai kera mlai di nah penui lung tak bam di. Penui kingnei kelak ne penui penui kwen nket pung di. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12" />Penui reugwame reu RAMPAUBE zai mede pe samdung kingnei kelak ne penui penui lung tsurakang nzwa tei taklu. Pa ndaa sam aidungde minadung dage pe Rabe gade, caihakecime dade langgai. Dede minadung kingnei kera mlai di, cine reugwame reu RAMPAUBE penuide pe ratasüt di. <verse eid="ZEC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13" />Pa qu gai kecudau, penui kingnei beu tadi. Ci siakte eh,” Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ranggai, “Penui acu qu zie, dede Ih kingnei lak. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14" />Rahang ge le Ih penuide penui ngau kemak heleuhdung dage tei zangra dizie, nah hangdeu cika migede lungh tadi zie. Migede hangdeu cikade tet kah mede cika cailigwang tadi zie kedanemene penui penui gu hangdeu keyi de hangdeu kemta ge tei kedine.”<verse eid="ZEC 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube Jerusalem de Samlambeu kera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE sam a da gwang, rang eh, <verse eid="ZEC 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2" />“Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Ih Zion<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zion </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jerusalem</char></note> minadung de hungla; Ih penuide hung süt nah penui ngauraume de Ih a rata süt bam! <verse eid="ZEC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Ih Zion ga cailigwang zie nah Jerusalem kakga lungh zie, Jerusalem de Kesang Namdi be de eh qu zie nah Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE lamlwatu de Kemci Lamlwatu de eh qu zie!<verse eid="ZEC 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:4">Kecingpei nah kecingpuidung Jerusalem lampuidung ga tet dai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:4">nah mileune de pe ba ga hetuitie pwa dai zie kedanemene penui cing zu kedine.<verse eid="ZEC 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5" />Namdi be lampuidung ga mipeina nah mipuinadung nggwa eh pui dai luzie. <verse eid="ZEC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:6">Magade cipau tingbadung ga mina bangkelume miakngau gade teigaikelak ge nzwa dicai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:6">cide a miakngau gade teigai kelak ge nzwa dizie ni?, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:23">Lei. 118:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEC 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:7">Ainie, Ih a minadung de naimiak kepetle nah naimiak kenlütle deu gade kelibeu lai eh bam!<verse eid="ZEC 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8" />Ih penuide naimiak kepetle gade kenlütle gage ngngwa gai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:8">nah penui Jerusalem kakga lungh zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:8">iciu eh penui a mina tei dai dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:8">nah kesang nah kesamsang gade Ih penui Tinggwang tei luzie!<verse eid="ZEC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:9">Nnui cu samdung aide siu bam kelame</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:9">caihakecime mui gade gwang kela de</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:9">a ki bang dwabeu kecu dau, a ki aide, Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:9">Nnui ba tei ngkinglu iciu eh kerecaki teilu kerane.<verse eid="ZEC 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10" />Kedanemene cipau tingdau dwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:10">migede hegurie nia hekwa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:10">mina nah makaune ziemne pemmi kette gah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:10">nah kemie kegwang leune da ngauraume ziemne lungciep kette gah.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:10">Ih hangge ge kecude pe kidame kerai peu ngngwa sia di.<verse eid="ZEC 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11" />Dede cu au tei gwang kedi tingdau nzwa lakta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:11">bangkelume aidungde da Ih la zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:11">aide reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="ZEC 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12" />Lungciep leuhbe linggai zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:12">kubebang petsi buibeu zie nah kideube petsi buibeu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:12">tinggimdung pe hezin keigai beuzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:12">kedanemene Ih mina bangkelume aidungde de peu ai pelane gumlu zie.<verse eid="ZEC 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13" />Nnui au heleuh kedadung ziemne keulia kegai reset ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:13">Judah nah Israel leuhme.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:13">Cine Ih nnuide kelibeu zie nah nnui au samlam ge zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:13">Ngngi so; nnui ba de peu ngkinglu!<verse eid="ZEC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14" />Kedanemene reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:14">Nnui paumedung a rata tei kegai ziemne Ih nnuide tei keherei kera riem kegai nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:14">reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ranggai, nah Ih cide tei tadi ma, <verse eid="ZEC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15" />cinzwa eh cudau de</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:15">Ih ma keyi Jerusalem nah Judahme da teigai kera riem gai dai zie!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:15">Ngngi so! <verse eid="ZEC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16" />Aidungde nnui tei maisia bi kerabedung: Kesangbe ranglu, hangge gede pe kidabe dage. Kesangbe, kemzuibe, nah nnui heriekidung ga lungciep bam eh tiaklu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:25">Eph. 4:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17" />Nnui mlung gade hangge ge dage makesia tei gai kera riem so, nah kenret sampetdung de nnui sui so, kedanemene aidungde Ih a sui ma!, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18" />Pecai reugwame reu RAMPAUBE sam a da gwang eh, ranggai,<verse eid="ZEC 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19" />“Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Kei mdai bekei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:19">kei mengei bekei, kei hena bekei, nah kei kerei bekei kemmwang mnei keladung de</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:19">Judahme ziemne suiyi ting ge, misui keyi, nah suiyi hengyidung ge zie!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:19">Ciziemne kesangbe nah lungciep de kulu!<verse eid="ZEC 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Minadung gwang dai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:20">namdidung ketsamtsam ga lungh kela leune de.<verse eid="ZEC 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21" />Namdi ge ga lungh kelame namdi kedage ga mie rang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:21">‘RAMPAUBE dwaga kelwa mie eh anui nggia kie go</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:21">nah reugwame reu RAMPAUBE de peei go! Anuide mie lau.’<verse eid="ZEC 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22" />Mina kekiee ge nah heleuh kengkingdung Jerusalem ga reugwame reu RAMPAUBE de peei gwang zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:22">nah RAMPAUBE ngaugia kie zie!<verse eid="ZEC 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide rangla: Cipau tingdau</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:23">helet nah heleuh leune gade mina hang kerei ge</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:23">n pai ri nzap lwe rang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:23">‘Anuide peu ncu nzang lo, kedanemene n da Tinggwang la lie kecu anui siu delu!’”<verse eid="ZEC 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9" />
  <para style="s">Israel Ngauraume reuga Tutiak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1" />“Hadrak deu nah pe kemtak ni Damascus namdi ziemne aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai sam; kedanemene minadung pelane nah Israel leuhme RAMPAUBE de pie kebamne. <verse eid="ZEC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2" />Ndu kegai sam aide Damascus de twagwapung kebam Hamath deu de ziemne de si, nah Tyre nah Sidon namdi de ziemne de si, kedanemene penui macisüt kebamne. <verse eid="ZEC 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3" />Tyre pekatei pe ziemne kengkiengbam ge kwacuh lu nah rangkanggeu le rebui nzwa kebaulu nah kecak teihemi kelube lampuidung ga niaksai nzwa. <verse eid="ZEC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4" />Pielo! Rampaube pa kebambe leune keuteu dizie nah jaaidi gade pe kengking tei ngkap dizie, cinzwa eh pecu mi le ru ngkap dizie. <verse eid="ZEC 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5" />Ashkelon namdi aide ngau eh hing dizie! Gaza namdi de hing eh mbeusütdi zie! Ekron namdi, pe keregui gah dizie! Hegwangpei Gaza gade gah dizie, nah Ashkelon ga mide lungh tadi zie! <verse eid="ZEC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6" />Sangme ne Ashdod namdi gage penui ki tei zie, nah Philistiame ngang kelade tei hena dizie. <verse eid="ZEC 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7" />Kedanemene Ih penui jai penui mui gade keu mpetdi zie nah penui heta kesiadung de penui geilim gade keu mpetdi zie. Ciu eh Judah leuhme ge nzwa penui Tinggwang ziemne bangkelume ge tei dizie, nah Ekronme Jebusiteme nzwa dizie.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8" />Ih a deu kwalu zie nah ngauraume gu reugwame de peu cika kahgwang mede caili lak, mide tei keherei kelame a mina reu ngking gai lak, kedanemene Ih cu a miak le ngaulu delu!<verse eid="ZEC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zion Gwangpei Gwang kera</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9" />Nnui sui yi eh sah lu, Zion minadung! Suiyi kwa sahlu, Jerusalem minadung!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Ainie! Nnui gwangpei nnui da masang eh gwangla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">nah nnuide kelibeu bam. Pa au pezai hena nah gada reu ga tetla, gada na ge reuga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 21:5, Jhn. 12:14-15</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10" />Pecai Ih Ephraim dade bagi keuteu dizie nah Jerusalem gade hekwen keu gidi zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">nah hereu ketei gade lakpi keu gidi zie; kedanemene pa heleuhdung dage kezuyibe ranggai beu zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">nah pe kengkieng jaaidi ge gade jaaidi ge ga kecang zie, nah Hereuki gade kideu nlidung kecang!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eph. 2:17, Lei. 72:8</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11" />Nnui ziemne au, a samkak jai de nnuida la kecune, Ih nnui baangme de dui kegah tekwa gade keli beu zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 26:28, Tet. 24:8, 1 Cor. 11:25</char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12" />Kengkiengbam ga cailigwang lulo, keregui kebam hebaangmedung! Henai de Ih nnui dage kena kieege peu dai beuzie de ranggai la, <verse eid="ZEC 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13" />kedanemene Ih Judah de a lakpi ge nzwa pwalu da. Ih Ephraim de le a lakpitsibung tei pui luda. Zion, Ih n napeimedung de teu ncuh luda, Greece, n napeimedung de regi kera, Zion, Ih ncu reugwame kingtie ge nzwa tei luda!”<verse eid="ZEC 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rampaube Miakngau Teigwang zie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14" />RAMPAUBE pe minadung dage pecu lia gai zie, nah pe lakpitsidung tingkehepik ge nzwa kap mpet zie! A Tinggwang RAMPAUBE telui kwa gai zie nah Teman gade rahangdung de nzang gwang zie. <verse eid="ZEC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE penuide gumlu zie, nah penui penui ngauraume reu ngkinglu zie nah tangnungtsidung de ngamlu zie. Pecai penui sak eh sak kemieme nzwa sah zie, nah penui zau le hekwakdung ge nzwa puilu zie, recabam kimiakdung nzwa. <verse eid="ZEC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16" />Cine cipau benai RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang penuide kelibeu zie, pe minadung kauhau nzwa. Penui au hegwang peurwa ga pemi kewhung tangtsudung nzwa pe deu ga baa bam zie. <verse eid="ZEC 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17" />Daikenzwa gede yi nah daikenzwa gede hezuyi zie bi! Rehangme meitsi gade nah relei kemcime zau kekumbe gade lungh yilu zie!<verse eid="ZEC 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube Judah Mapie zie</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1" />Heriak tingrui tingdau RAMPAUBE dade tingrui kielu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">rahangdung tei kegai RAMPAUBE,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">nah pa tingrui mileune de peula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">nah luh ga giniadung reu ga rui gaibeu la.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2" />Mina mamiedung kenret rangbeu la; rekame kenretpe ngau la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">penui mide kecwa hemang rangbeu la nah kemrwa lungciep peu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">cine minadung meurün nzwa huirwa ladi nah keherei di kedanemene meurün kekwabe gah kecune.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 9:36, Hab. 2:18-19</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3" />“Meurün kekwamedung reuga a lunghop bamla; cide au hemeuseudung, muiteumedung, Ih saja peugai kerame. Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Judah kauhau maa ga lazie, nah penuide hereu ketei ga pe hereukwendung nzwa tei zie! <verse eid="ZEC 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4" />Judah dade kimiaktsube pet zie; pe dade paiki teu kegim tie pet zie; pe dade hereu lakpi gwang zie; pe dade hegwangme leune gwang ncüt luzie. <verse eid="ZEC 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5" />Penui au reugwame penui ngauraume de hereu ketei ga lampui niaksai gage cai kedui kegaime nzwa zie; penui hereu tei zie, kedanemene penui da RAMPAUBE lalu, nah hereukwendung teu kelame de keu hengam tei zie. <verse eid="ZEC 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6" />Ih Judahme de tei ngking beu zie nah Joseph leuhme de kelibeu zie; Ih penuide peu lunghyi dailu zie nah penuide ngaunggia beu zie. Penuide Ih madaude lang gidi kemak nzwa dizie, kedanemene Ih RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang, nah Ih penui kekie teibeu zie. <verse eid="ZEC 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7" />Pecai Ephraim leuhme reugwame ge nzwalu zie, nah penui mlung au zau kesakme nzwa penui sui yizie; penui namedung aide ngau eh penui sui yizie. A da penui sui yila zie!<verse eid="ZEC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8" />Ih penuide qu gai zie nah penuide hekwalu zie, kedanemene Ih penuide kelibeu zie, nah penuide ndaa nzwa tei ngkiee süt beuzie! <verse eid="ZEC 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9" />Ih penuide heleuhdung dage teizang gaidi, dede penui acu heni kemdeidung gade nsunglu zie, cine penui nah penui namedung ringlu zie nah cailigwang dailu zie. <verse eid="ZEC 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10" />Ih penuide Egyptme deu gade kelibeu zie nah Assyria gade penuide teugwang hekwa luzie. Ih penuide Gilead nah Lebanon deu gage ngngwa gwang gai beu zie penui ziemne heni puidi kemaktane. <verse eid="ZEC 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11" />Ih penui rei jaaidi gade kahgwang zie; Ih jaaidi ga dui nswak kebam de kedeu gai zie na Nile kecok de tei cang dizie. Ngang kela Assyriame de tei hena dizie, nah Egyptme hegwang tuitie de penui dade tetdi zie. <verse eid="ZEC 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12" />Ih a kengking teu penuide tei ngking beuzie, nah penui a zi gade tet zie, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.”<verse eid="ZEC 10:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1" />N kikamdung ngkei gailo, Lebanon, cinzwa eh mi le nnui gu cedar bangdung ru ngkap di kera!<verse eid="ZEC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2" />Hei eh haplu, cypress bangdung, kedanemene cedar bangdung kau kedine! Dai yi bi cidungde ngkap kwa dida!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">Hei eh haplu, Bashan ga mhu bangdung, kedanemene hegung kedige kau kedine.<verse eid="ZEC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3" />Meurün kekwame hei eh hap, kedanemene penui kemdu ngkap kedine!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">Hinghodung mra gai, kedanemene Jordan Langkam Reuki hegie kelade ngkap kedine!<verse eid="ZEC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meurün kekwa Kena</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4" />Aide a RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ne ranggai, “Meurün kekwabe nzwa, meurün hau daptsetdi kera kai pwa kebam maa pie regum lo! <verse eid="ZEC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5" />(Penuide lui nah daptset kecume de au saja peu ma, nah penuide zwa kegaime, ‘RAMPAUBE de twa! Ih au hei dida!’ de eh rangla kedanemene meurün hau mpaume ziemne heta tei kelame meurün kekwamedung meurünnadung de nggia la kemakne.) <verse eid="ZEC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6" />Ih kideu ga migede de ngau nggia si lakta!, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai. Pielo! Ih ne peu mina hangge ge kecude pe kidame nah pe hegwangpei ba gage kai dizie, nah penui ne kideu de tei msia dizie nah Ih migede de penui ba gade kelibeu lak.” <verse eid="ZEC 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7" />Cine meurün kezwame nah keluime ne daptsetdi lai eh kebam meurün hau ziemne Ih kekwabe teilu. Ih hetuitie kena keulu; ket de, “Kengha” nah keda de, “Ket ketei” lie eh qu. Ainzwa eh Ih meurün hau de kwa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8" />Kei ge gage Ih kemau meurün kekwabe hangcum de tei ngkap di. Ih penui dade a lung dui di, nah penuide acu ngkau di. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9" />Pecai Ih pe mpaume dade ranggai, “Ih nnui meurün kekwabe tei si lak ta. Meurün tsai lai eh kebambedung, penuide peu tsai di; tei ngkap kebam meuründung de, peu penuide ngkapti. Bang kebeube meuründung de peu penui hangge gede pe kidabe teih de tyeilu.” <verse eid="ZEC 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10" />Cine Ih “Kengha” tuitie de keulu nah a leuhme da samkak kelude tei nggah di kerane cide tei cum di. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11" />Cipau benai samkak kelu de teipang di, nah meurün kezwame nah keluime nah acu pie kebamme RAMPAUBE ne ranggai lie kecu cilu. <verse eid="ZEC 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" />Ih penuide ranggai, “Nnui neula cai, acu a ziehi peulo. Dede nnui neu mecai, a ziehi peu so.” Cine penui a ziehi teibeu, rangkanggeu camrei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:15">Mat. 26:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Pecai RAMPAUBE a dage ranggai, “Rangkanggeu cide mabam kibung gage kaidi lu, pemi keyi penui ncu peu kebeu de!” Cine Ih rangkanggeu camrei de keulu nah RAMPAUBE kerecaki mabam gage kaidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:9">Mat. 27:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:10">10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14" />Pecai a tuitie pe kenabe de teicum di, “Ket ketei,” Judah nah Israel ket ketei de teipang di.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15" />RAMPAUBE a dage ranggai, “Kemie meurün kekwabe niadung mie n katei n ziemne keu dai lulo, <verse eid="ZEC 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16" />kedanemene pielo, Ih meurün kekwabe ge de kideu gage kaibeu zie. Pa au ngkap kebam meuründung maa pie regum beu lak. Pa gah kedi meurün de mie peei lak, nah pe pi sia kedi meurün de tei ngkei beu lak. Pelui keyi meuründung de matyei kera peu lak, dede meurün catube teih tyei nah penui nginglwakdung teipang dizie.<verse eid="ZEC 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17" />Pemikegah meurünkekwabe kauhau de gidi kelabe da keherei gwang zieda!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">Peu kingtie de pe ba nah pe zetle miak gwang tei dilu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">Peu pe ba tsai di nah pe zetle miak cietdi lu!”<verse eid="ZEC 11:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem Ngauraume de Ngkapdi kera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne Israelme ziemne ndu kegai sam, RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, tinggimdung teu mtie kelube nah kideube dam kegaibe, mina de rabe pwa kepeube, <verse eid="ZEC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2" />“Pielo, Ih Jerusalem de hepiak ge gage tei gai dilai eh zeu twagwakebam minadung de peu tet nkoi zie. Cide au Jerusalem de ketang eh twagwa kedi nzwa eh Judah namdi de liede cide nzwa teizie. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3" />Cipau benai, Ih mina pelane ziemne Jerusalem de tangtsu rütsüt kecuge tei dizie. Keheibe de cipau tangtsu de pwa kera tei cube pekatei pecu rezam msia sütdi zie, nah kideu ga heleuhdung pelane cipau namdibe de renia zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 21:24, Mat. 21:44</char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4" />Cipau benai, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, Ih hekwen pelane de keheu eh kemeu dizie nah teu kelame de tei mang dizie. Judahme kigade Ih a miak ngkei zie, dede minadung gu kwendung penui pelane miak Ih tei cietdi zie. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5" />Ciu eh Judah muiteume penui mlungdung gade rang zie, ‘Jerusalem ga kelunghmedung anui kengking da, kedanemene RAMPAUBE, penui Tinggwang ziemne.’ <verse eid="ZEC 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6" />Cipau benai Ih Judah muiteume de hetsing kakga mibung ge tei dizie nah meibui sap kebam kakga miheu kebaabung nzwa tei dizie, kedanemene penui zetle nah penui hile twagwakebam minadung de mnwa pwadi zielu. Jerusalem pekatei pebam gade lungh dai zie.” <verse eid="ZEC 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7" />RAMPAUBE Judahme paikidung de keli rai beuzie, ciu eh David leuhme nah Jerusalem ga lungh kebamme herüt de Judahme leune swa de diki dilak. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8" />Cipau benai RAMPAUBE Jerusalem ga lungh kebamme de gumbeu zie, nah cipau benai caugamme nnei labi cipaume David nzwa dizie, ciciu eh David ki de Tinggwang nzwa dizie, penui dwa gade RAMPAUBE tinggimgwame nzwa dizie. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9" />“Cipau benai Jerusalem de renia kera heleuhdung kegwang pelane de tei ngkap dizie.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10" />Dede Ih ngaugia rabe rui gai zie nah David leuhme nah Jerusalem ga lunghkebamme dade kengha kie zie, ciciu eh penui acu pie zie, penui ne reutset kedibe de. Penui a ziemne hap zie, mige pena pumli ziemne kehap nzwa; penui penui sui siasütdi eh hap dizie mige pena mipeina mna raitube tsai eh hap kecu nzwa zie. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11" />Cipau benai Jerusalem hap kegai de Hadad Rimmon ga Megiddo langkie gade hap kegai nzwa dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:16">Keu. 16:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12" />Hangdeu de hap dizie, pautsa ketket kecu kedabe pautsame gade teuntsam dizie. David kilung gade kepet pautsame de teuntsam dizie nah penui naudung mipeidung dade teuntsam dizie. Nathan kilung gade kepet pautsame de teuntsam dizie nah penui naudung de mipeidung dade teuntsam dizie. <verse eid="ZEC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13" />Levi kilung gade kepet pautsame de teuntsam dizie nah penui naudung de mipeidung dade teuntsam dizie. Shimei pautsame de teuntsam dizie nah penui naudung de mipeidung dade teuntsam dizie. <verse eid="ZEC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14" />Pautsamedung gade pautsa kebangdung leune gade, pautsame ketket kecu teuntsam dizie nah penaudung mipeidung dade teuntsam dizie.”<verse eid="ZEC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13" />
  <para style="s">Kemau gade Teikemci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1" />“Cipau benai duilet ge David leuhme nah Jerusalem ga kelunghme ziemne ngkei pwapeu zie, penuide kemaudung nah mcikemak gade teimci beu kerane. <verse eid="ZEC 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2" />Cipau benai, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, Ih hangdeu gade mamiedung gu hezidung de tei nggah dizie nah penuide nsungdai silak. Ih caihakecimedung nah mcikemak rabedung de hangdeu gade keugi dizie. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3" />Mi keheibe de cairasam rangbam dai cai, pe pei nah pe pui pecu mna kelube pecu rangzie, ‘Nang ring gailak, kedanemene nang RAMPAUBE zi teu kenret rangkela ne!’ Pecai pe pei nah pe pui pecu mna kelube pa cairasamdung kerang dau pecu reutset zie. <verse eid="ZEC 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4" />Cipau benai caihakecime ketket kecu ngngam dizie pa cairasam rang eh marengei kengau dau. Minadung de cwa kerane, caihakeci aidungde pemai ketei paiheni dung teudai silak. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5" />Kedanemene hangge ge kecu rang zie, ‘Ih au kenret caihakecibe ma! Ih au tangdei tadung keteibe, kedanemene hangdeu de a tah dida Ih hena kebam dau gade!’ <verse eid="ZEC 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6" />Magade mige pecu keteu cai, ‘N ba kena kakga rezam pwa kebamde daino?’ nah pa samkeli zie, ‘Ih azangme kigade acu rezam di lie.’”<verse eid="ZEC 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meurün Kekwabe de Kedeudi, Meuründung Zangra di</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7" />“Kingtie! N katei cuh lu a meurünkekwabe de renia eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">mina a taiga nna la kelabe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">aide Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">Meurünkekwabe de keheu di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">nah kauhaudung tetzang dizie!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">Kedanemene Ih a ba kemneimedung de renia cuh zie.<verse eid="ZEC 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8" />Pecai kideu pelane ga ainzwa gwang dizie, aide RAMPAUBE ndugai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:8">zicum gade zina de teinggah dizie! Cipau minadung de kap eh gah dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:8">zicum gade zige rünne bam zie.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9" />Ih cipau pekecumbe de mi gade ngngwa gwangzie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">nah rangkanggeu teihemi dai kelu nzwa teihemi zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">Ih penuide kecak de kedakpie cu nzwa kedak zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">Penui a zi quzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">nah Ih penui sam keli eh rangzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">‘Aide a minadung da!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">nah penui rang zie, ‘RAMPAUBE au a Tinggwang!’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pet. 1:7, Lei. 91:15, Jer. 30:22</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 13:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube Gwang Hegwang teizie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1" />Ainie! RAMPAUBE hetutiak tingba de gwang zeuda nnui ma süt kelude nnui kebam gade mzi pwa dizie. <verse eid="ZEC 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2" />Kedanemene Ih heleuh pelane de Jerusalem de renia kera teugwang hekwa lu eh hereu tei kerane nah namdi cide tuilu zie. Hekidung ga hema dungde keuteu dizie nah mipuidung de teuhdi zie. Namdi pempie gede ngngwa tet eh hebaang teizie, dede mina kebangdungde de peu namdi gade ngngwa tetdi lak. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3" />Dede RAMPAUBE tetpet zie nah heleuh cidungde de ngngwa hereu teizie pa hereu tei eh keregi cu benai nzwa. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4" />Cipau benai pe pi Olive deutu ga sap zie, cide au Jerusalem caile naimiak kepetle ga. Olive Deutu de di süt kecu chabak ge ne naimiak kepetle nah naimiak kenlütle kakgage mzi pempie tei dizie nah lamlwa pempie naimiak kepetle nah naimiak kenlütle lambie ge caili mie dizie. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5" />Pecai nnui RAMPAUBE lamlwadung kak chabak ga pak hung zie, kedanemene cipau lamlwadung kak chabak de Azel ga gwangcang zie. Judah gwangpei, Uzziah tingbadung nlui teu kecu gade pak kecu nzwa eh nnui pak zie. Pecai RAMPAUBE a Tinggwang gwang zie nah kemcime pelane peda la dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 24:30-31, 1 The. 3:13, Jud. 1:14</char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6" />Cipau benai cika kebaa bam lak, dede ngkung mede nchui de lak. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7" />Cipau benai, tingba cide RAMPAUBE rünne ci, cika tingba mede tingmui bamsi lak, kedanemene tinghegi de kebaa ting dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 21:23; 22:5</char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8" />Cipau benai kering dui Jerusalem gade lwa pet zie. Penui pempie ge naimiak kepetle jaaidi nah naimiak kenlütle jaaidi gage lwa gai zie, hepwak dau nah tingka dau.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eze. 47:1, Keu. 22:1,17 </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9" />RAMPAUBE ne kideu reu pelane ga hegwang tei zie. Cipau benai cika RAMPAUBE bam zie, ket Tinggwang, nah pe zi rünne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:15">Keu. 11:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10" />Hangdeu pelane Arabah de nzwa dizie, Geba namceu gade Rimmon namceu ga Jerusalem gu tingbangle. Jerusalem teuncuh bammui zie nah pekatei pe heni ga, Benjamin Kirie gade daiga heni raitube kirie bambi, Kimiak Kirie ga, nah Hananel renei gade hegwangme zau keniakbam ga. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11" />Minadung Jerusalem ga lungh zie nah cika penui reuga Tinggwang ne ngkap zing kecu bamsi lak. Jerusalem ziune eh lungh zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:3">Keu. 22:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEC 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12" />Jerusalem de hereu tei renia kecume mina pelane de RAMPAUBE rapia aide le ketang zie: Penui pumteih tim dizie penui pi ne sap eh bam liede. Penui miakdung pekoiki ga pangpop zie nah penui mleu penui muidung ga pangpop zie. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13" />Cipau benai RAMPAUBE dade kengngi kedi cide penui kakga gwang zie. Hangge ge kecu kedabe ba tui zie, nah hangge pe ba hwacuh kedabe ba de renia zie. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14" />Judahme liede Jerusalem de renia eh keregi zie. Penui twagwa kebam heleuh pelane mahei de keu hekwa luzie, kecak, rangkanggeu, nah paihenidung keyi kekiee ge. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15" />Rapia ge hekwendung nah hekwen keceunadung da liede gwang zie, utdung nah gadadung, nah makaune pelane cipau ramzeukidung ga kebamme rapia cide gade keherei zie.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16" />Pecai cide teigwang zie ciu eh cipau heleuhdung ga kebangbe pelane Jerusalem de renia gwang kecume iciu meliene mmi ramsangne hegwangpei reugwame reu RAMPAUBE de reca kera tet hang zie, nah Paiki Ngyi de mneilu kerane. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17" />Cide teigwang zie ciu eh migede kideureu ga heleuhdung pelane gade hegwangpei RAMPAUBE de reca kera Jerusalem ga hang melie cai, iciu cai reugwame reu RAMPAUBE penui reu gage tingrui teugwang beulak. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18" />Magade Egypt leuhme hanglu mecai, iciu cai penui tingrui ngau gailak. Paiki Ngyi de hanglwe mneilu kemakme de RAMPAUBE rapiage le heleuhdung de ketang zie. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19" />Aide Egyptme ziemne saja ge zie nah heleuh pelane Paiki Ngyi ga hanglwe mneilu kemakme ziemne saja ge da. <verse eid="ZEC 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20" />Dede cipau benai, hekwendung gu nteidung rang zie, “RAMPAUBE dage keumpet ntsam lu,” nah lidung de RAMPAUBE kiga ratakbam dwaga de hekwakdung nzwa di zie. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21" />Kedanemene Jerusalem nah Judah ga libung pelane reugwame reu RAMPAUBE dage keumpet ntsam zie nah mikeheibe reca teugwang kelame penui dade tyei nah penui da helum zie. Cipau benai helila ketei Canaanme reugwame reu RAMPAUBE kiga bamsi tadi zie.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>